  "launches": [
    {
      "id": 82043,
      "title": "Corgi Insurance",
      "tagline": "Corgi is the first insurance carrier built for startups and technology companies.",
      "body": "Corgi is a full-stack insurance carrier building better, faster insurance products for [startups](https://www.corgi.insure/startup-insurance). We’re not a broker, so we underwrite and issue policies directly, with fewer handoffs, less friction, and better pricing. Cutting out intermediaries lets us tailor coverage to how your company actually operates and price risk more efficiently.\n\nGet an instant quote for all common startup coverages at [www.corgi.insure](https://www.corgi.insure). Corgi provides the following lines of coverage, and more:\n\n* [Directors and Officers Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/do-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Commercial General Liability Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/cgl-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Technology Errors & Omissions Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/tech-eo-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Cyber Liability Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/cyber-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Employment Practices Liability Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/epli-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Media Liability Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/media-liability-insurance-for-startups)\n* [Hired and Non-Owned Auto Insurance](https://www.corgi.insure/blog/hnoa-insurance-for-startups)\n* Representations & Warranties Insurance\n\nGet an instant quote online or [talk](https://www.corgi.insure/get-advisor) to a licensed insurance representative to learn about your startup’s risk exposure and insurance needs.\n\n![uploaded image](/media/?type=post&id=82043&key=user_uploads/1990806/a3293664-e7bb-43d5-90e4-8cbab5d79ec7)\n\n",
      "url": "https://www.ycombinator.com/launches/LLH-corgi-insurance",
      "votes": 43,
      "created_at": "2024-07-11T14:16:58.271Z"
    }
  ]
